# Atop: + cannot add the function that - gives used monadically;
# the error points at the +.
== SOURCE
[+ -] 1 2
== ERROR
error[type-mismatch]: expected a number, found a -> a at 1..2
  note: in the train `[+ -]`, `+` is applied as `+ (- x)`, where x is the train's argument
  note: `-` takes two arguments, so `- x` is a function waiting for the other
